{"step_index":57,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-17T04:22:11Z","model":"gpt-oss-120b-medium","input_tokens":33346,"cache_read_tokens":3839,"output_tokens":567,"thinking":"We need orders.js and checkout.js, profile.html and profile.js.\n\nImplement simple order creation.\n\nCreate checkout.js with logic to display cart items, calculate total, handle form submit, validate cart, stock, create order, update storage, clear cart, show confirmation.\n\nCreate orders.js to list orders for current customer with details and link to view details (could be same page expand).\n\nCreate profile.html and profile.js to show and edit.\n\nAlso need to ensure paths correct.\n\nAdd profile.html.\n\nLet's write profile.html.","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n    <title>My Profile - Simple E‑Commerce</title>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"../assets/css/style.css\" />\n</head>\n<body>\n    <header>\n        <nav id=\"navbar\"></nav>\n    </header>\n    <main class=\"container\" id=\"profilePage\">\n        <h1>My Profile</h1>\n        <form id=\"profileForm\">\n            <label for=\"name\">Name:</label><br />\n            <input type=\"text\" id=\"name\" required /><br />\n            <label for=\"email\">Email (read‑only):</label><br />\n            <input type=\"email\" id=\"email\" disabled /><br />\n            <label for=\"phone\">Phone:</label><br />\n            <input type=\"tel\" id=\"phone\" /><br />\n            <label for=\"address\">Delivery Address:</label><br />\n            <textarea id=\"address\" rows=\"3\"></textarea><br />\n            <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn\">Save Changes</button>\n        </form>\n    </main>\n    <footer class=\"footer\"><p>&copy; 2026 Simple E‑Commerce</p></footer>\n    <script src=\"../assets/js/storage.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"../assets/js/auth.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"../assets/js/main.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"profile.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>","Overwrite":true,"Path":"C:\\Users\\MY-PC\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\68b1e791-e5ed-4ad6-9fc6-05d27d9c0cc7\\customer\\profile.html"}}]}
{"step_index":58,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-17T04:22:15Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-17T09:52:15+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-11-17T09:52:15+05:30\nCreated At: 2026-11-17T09:52:15+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-11-17T09:52:15+05:30\nCreated file."}
{"step_index":59,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-17T04:22:15Z","model":"gpt-oss-120b-medium","input_tokens":33871,"cache_read_tokens":3839,"output_tokens":1801,"thinking":"Now need to implement checkout logic, orders page, profile page scripts, and ensure cart handling etc. Also need to make sure paths are correct, relative from customer folder.\n\nWe need to create checkout.js, orders.js, profile.js.\n\nImplement order processing: read cart, check stock, create order object, update products stock, save order, clear cart, show confirmation.\n\nCreate orders.js: list orders for the logged-in customer, show basic info and link to details (maybe same page). Since no separate order details page required, we can expand each order.\n\nProfile.js: load session, display info, allow editing phone/address, save to user record.\n\nAlso need to ensure storage.js has schema for orders array. It currently sets orders empty.\n\nWhen placing order, we need to generate orderId, maybe using timestamp.\n\nImplement code.\n\nAlso modify main.js? Already loads navigation.\n\nMake sure checkout page includes order summary generation from cart.\n\nCreate checkout.js: on DOMContentLoaded, fetch cart items, render summary table. On form submit, process order: validate fields (full name, address, phone, payment method). Use storage.getCart to get items. For each item, get product, ensure stock >= quantity. If insufficient, alert and stop. Then reduce stock, push order to orders array with fields: orderId, customerId, sellerId (maybe multiple sellers? For simplicity, store sellerId of each product not needed). Since it's multi-vendor but we could store array of items each with sellerId.\n\nWe'll create order object:\n\n{\n orderId: 'ORD-'+Date.now(),\n customerId: sess.userId,\n items: [{productId, quantity, price}], // price from product.price\n total: computed,\n paymentMethod,\n paymentStatus: 'paid' for UPI/Card, 'pending' for COD,\n deliveryStatus: 'Placed',\n deliveryAddress: { name: fullName, address, phone },\n orderDate: new Date().toISOString()\n}\n\nAlso include sellerId per item if needed but not essential for now.\n\nSave order: get orders array, push, set.\n\nUpdate product stock: for each item, find product, subtract quantity, if stock becomes 0 set status 'out_of_stock'.\n\nUpdate storage.\n\nClear cart.\n\nShow confirmation with orderId.\n\nNow orders.js: fetch orders, filter by customerId, render cards.\n\nProfile.js: get session, display name, email, phone, address (need to store phone and address in user profile). In storage, user object currently has name, email, password, role. We'll add fields: phone, address. When user updates, modify user in users array and also update session name.\n\nImplement.\n\nNow code files.\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"// checkout.js – renders cart summary and processes order placement\n(function(){\n    const storage = window.StorageAPI;\n    const sess = storage.getSession();\n    if(!sess || sess.role!=='customer'){\n        alert('Please log in as a customer');\n        window.location.href='../login.html';\n        return;\n    }\n    const summaryDiv = document.getElementById('orderSummary');\n    const form = document.getElementById('checkoutForm');\n    const confirmDiv = document.getElementById('confirmationMessage');\n    const orderIdDisplay = document.getElementById('orderIdDisplay');\n\n    function renderSummary(){\n        const cart = storage.getCart(sess.userId);\n        if(cart.length===0){\n            summaryDiv.innerHTML = '<p>Your cart is empty.</p>';\n            form.style.display='none';\n            return;\n        }\n        const products = storage.get(storage.keys.products) || [];\n        let total = 0;\n        const table = document.createElement('table');\n        table.innerHTML = `<tr><th>Product</th><th>Qty</th><th>Price</th><th>Sub‑total</th></tr>`;\n        cart.forEach(item=>{\n            const prod = products.find(p=>p.id===item.productId);\n            if(!prod) return;\n            const sub = prod.price * item.quantity;\n            total += sub;\n            const row = document.createElement('tr');\n            row.innerHTML = `<td>${prod.name}</td><td>${item.quantity}</td><td>₹${prod.price.toFixed(2)}</td><td>₹${sub.toFixed(2)}</td>`;\n            table.appendChild(row);\n        });\n        const totalRow = document.createElement('tr');\n        totalRow.innerHTML = `<td colspan=\"3\"><strong>Total</strong></td><td><strong>₹${total.toFixed(2)}</strong></td>`;\n        table.appendChild(totalRow);\n        summaryDiv.innerHTML = '';\n        summaryDiv.appendChild(table);\n    }\n\n    function placeOrder(event){\n        event.preventDefault();\n        const cart = storage.getCart(sess.userId);\n        if(cart.length===0){\n            alert('Cart is empty');\n            return;\n        }\n        // gather form data\n        const fullName = document.getElementById('fullName').value.trim();\n        const address = document.getElementById('address').value.trim();\n        const phone = document.getElementById('phone').value.trim();\n        const paymentMethod = document.getElementById('paymentMethod').value;\n        if(!fullName || !address || !phone){\n            alert('Please fill all delivery fields');\n            return;\n        }\n        // verify stock availability\n        const products = storage.get(storage.keys.products) || [];\n        for(const item of cart){\n            const prod = products.find(p=>p.id===item.productId);\n            if(!prod){ alert('Product not found: '+item.productId); return; }\n            if(item.quantity > prod.stock){\n                alert(`Insufficient stock for ${prod.name}. Available: ${prod.stock}`);\n                return;\n            }\n        }\n        // build order object\n        const orderId = 'ORD-'+Date.now();\n        const orderItems = cart.map(item=>{\n            const prod = products.find(p=>p.id===item.productId);\n            return {\n                productId: prod.id,\n                sellerId: prod.sellerId,\n                name: prod.name,\n                price: prod.price,\n                quantity: item.quantity,\n                subTotal: prod.price * item.quantity\n            };\n        });\n        const totalAmount = orderItems.reduce((sum,i)=>sum+i.subTotal,0);\n        const order = {\n            orderId,\n            customerId: sess.userId,\n            items: orderItems,\n            total: totalAmount,\n            paymentMethod,\n            paymentStatus: (paymentMethod==='COD') ? 'pending' : 'paid',\n            deliveryStatus: 'Placed',\n            deliveryAddress: { name: fullName, address, phone },\n            orderDate: new Date().toISOString()\n        };\n        // update product stock\n        orderItems.forEach(oi=>{\n            const prod = products.find(p=>p.id===oi.productId);\n            prod.stock -= oi.quantity;\n            if(prod.stock===0) prod.status='out_of_stock';\n        });\n        // persist updates\n        storage.set(storage.keys.products, products);\n        const orders = storage.get(storage.keys.orders) || [];\n        orders.push(order);\n        storage.set(storage.keys.orders, orders);\n        // clear cart\n        storage.setCart(sess.userId, []);\n        // show confirmation\n        form.style.display='none';\n        summaryDiv.style.display='none';\n        orderIdDisplay.textContent = `Your order ID is ${orderId}`;\n        confirmDiv.style.display='block';\n    }\n\n    // init\n    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function(){\n        renderSummary();\n        form.addEventListener('submit', placeOrder);\n    });\n})();","Overwrite":true,"Path":"C:\\Users\\MY-PC\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\68b1e791-e5ed-4ad6-9fc6-05d27d9c0cc7\\customer\\checkout.js"}}]}
