{"step_index":61,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-17T04:22:25Z","model":"gpt-oss-120b-medium","input_tokens":35190,"cache_read_tokens":3839,"output_tokens":814,"thinking":"We need to add orders.js and profile.js files. Also need to ensure relative paths for CSS/JS are correct. The dashboard uses dashboard.js placed in same folder, correct. The checkout page references checkout.js; placed correctly. The orders page references orders.js; need to create orders.js. Also profile.js.\n\nImplementation of orders.js: show list of orders for logged-in customer, with details expandable or link to order details page (could be a modal). Simplicity: list with order ID, date, total, status, and a button to view details that expands within page.\n\nLet's create orders.js accordingly.\n\nSimilarly profile.js: load session and user info, allow edit of name, phone, address stored maybe in user profile field. Currently user objects have fields: id, role, name, email, password. Could add phone, address fields optional. We'll just store these in the user record. On save, update the user array.\n\nWe'll also need to populate profile fields on load.\n\nImplement orders.js.\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"// orders.js – displays customer's order history\n(function(){\n    const storage = window.StorageAPI;\n    const sess = storage.getSession();\n    if(!sess || sess.role!=='customer'){\n        alert('Login as a customer');\n        window.location.href='../login.html';\n        return;\n    }\n    const orders = storage.get(storage.keys.orders) || [];\n    const myOrders = orders.filter(o=>o.customerId===sess.userId).reverse(); // newest first\n    const listDiv = document.getElementById('ordersList');\n    if(myOrders.length===0){\n        listDiv.innerHTML = '<p>No orders placed yet.</p>';\n        return;\n    }\n    myOrders.forEach(order=>{\n        const div = document.createElement('div');\n        div.className='card';\n        div.innerHTML = `\n            <p><strong>Order ID:</strong> ${order.orderId}</p>\n            <p><strong>Date:</strong> ${new Date(order.orderDate).toLocaleString()}</p>\n            <p><strong>Total:</strong> ₹${order.total.toFixed(2)}</p>\n            <p><strong>Payment:</strong> ${order.paymentMethod} (${order.paymentStatus})</p>\n            <p><strong>Status:</strong> ${order.deliveryStatus}</p>\n            <button class=\"btn\" data-id=\"${order.orderId}\">View Details</button>\n            <div class=\"details\" id=\"details-${order.orderId}\" style=\"display:none; margin-top:0.5rem;\"></div>\n        `;\n        listDiv.appendChild(div);\n        const btn = div.querySelector('button');\n        const detailsDiv = div.querySelector('.details');\n        btn.addEventListener('click', function(){\n            if(detailsDiv.style.display==='none'){\n                // build details view\n                const itemsHtml = order.items.map(it=>`<li>${it.name} (x${it.quantity}) – ₹${it.price.toFixed(2)} each</li>`).join('');\n                detailsDiv.innerHTML = `<ul>${itemsHtml}</ul>`;\n                detailsDiv.style.display='block';\n                btn.textContent='Hide Details';\n            } else {\n                detailsDiv.style.display='none';\n                btn.textContent='View Details';\n            }\n        });\n    });\n})();","Path":"C:\\Users\\MY-PC\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\68b1e791-e5ed-4ad6-9fc6-05d27d9c0cc7\\customer\\orders.js"}}]}
